	(text "Blanking sits BETWEEN the stages: 60 pC of DG419 charge injection lands on C720 = 10 nF as 6 mV, not on the 1.25 nF tank as 48 mV. Interstage coupling 10 nF / 10 k = 1.59 kHz, so the receiver recovers in 0.3 ms instead of the 300 ms a 1 uF / 100 k would need (section 3.3). RX_BLANK: 0 = blanked (default, 10 k pull-down R724), 1 = receive — an un-driven GPIO leaves the receiver blanked."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 25.4 0)
