	(text "Quadrature LO: the Si5351 phase register cannot do 90 deg below 4.72 MHz (PHOFF is 7 bit in units of T_VCO/4, AN619 section 6). U702 is a 2-bit Johnson counter on CLK1 = 4*f_LO: FF1 D = /Q2, FF2 D = Q1 -> LO_I and LO_Q exactly 90 deg apart at any frequency (section 1.4). Pulse /CLR after every PLLB change so the counter always starts in state 00."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
